  "concept": { "zh": "定时炸弹 · 支路取货 · 10 回合", "en": "Countdown bomb · Cargo siding · Ten turns" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "支路里有一个货箱，打开它，再把货送到最右边的出口。标着 7 的炸弹只在第 7 回合结束时影响它所在的格子和上下左右紧邻的地板。经过受影响的格子要选对时间；原地等待会用掉一回合。全程最多 10 回合。",
    "en": "Open the cargo chest on the siding and deliver it to the exit on the right. The bomb marked 7 flashes at the end of turn 7 only, on its own square and the four adjacent floor squares. Time your crossing. Waiting takes one turn, and you have 10 turns in total."
  },
  "hints": [],
